<h2 id="the-core-problem-it-solves" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#the-core-problem-it-solves" class="header-mark"></a>The Core Problem It Solves</h2><p>An ordinary terminal window is bound to its processes. Close the window and the processes die. Same story when SSH drops.</p>]]></description></item></channel></rss>